WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 size:90%
At first, recovery felt like a long
way from the life I knew.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000 size:90%
I missed our afternoons together: a
quiet seat outside, a conversation,
time without watching the clock.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 size:90%
I began to talk about those everyday
things when I talked about my goals.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 size:90%
Some days called for patience. On
others, I noticed a small change and
let myself feel hopeful.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000 size:90%
Being together again did not mean
every challenge had disappeared.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000 size:90%
It meant there was room for the things
I loved, alongside the care I still
needed.
